# Input switching over DDC/CI without root (docs/research/linux-support.md, section 7): the
# logged-in user may read and write the i2c buses of graphics cards (PCI class 0x03), as ddcutil's
# 60-ddcutil-i2c.rules does. Installs to /usr/lib/udev/rules.d/.
SUBSYSTEM=="i2c-dev", KERNEL=="i2c-[0-9]*", ATTRS{class}=="0x03*", TAG+="uaccess"
